#line 1 "OCCURS.cbl"
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. OCCURS.


 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 TBL.
 05 ROW OCCURS 3 TIMES.
 10 CELL PIC 9(2) OCCURS 4 TIMES.
 10 TAG PIC X.
 01 VEC.
 05 V PIC S9(3) COMP-3 OCCURS 5 VALUE 7.
 01 I PIC 9(2).
 01 J PIC 9(2).
 01 TOT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
 01 ABC PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
 DISPLAY "[" TBL "]" 
 PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 3
 MOVE ABC (I:1) TO TAG (I)
 PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > 4
 COMPUTE CELL (I, J) = I * 10 + J
 END-PERFORM
 END-PERFORM
 DISPLAY "[" TBL "]" 
 DISPLAY CELL (2, 3) " " CELL (3, 1) " " TAG (2)
 MOVE 2 TO I
 DISPLAY CELL (I + 1, I - 1) " " ROW (I)
 PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
 ADD I TO V (I)
 ADD V (I) TO TOT
 END-PERFORM
 DISPLAY V (1) " " V (5) " " TOT
 MOVE ROW (1) TO ROW (3)
 DISPLAY "[" TBL "]" 
 STOP RUN.
